---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="Read the Antons Blocked Drains Lower North Shore privacy policy covering contact details, drainage job information, website data and privacy enquiries.">
  <article class="legal-page"><h1>Privacy Policy</h1><p>Last updated 21 October 2026.</p><h2>Who We Are</h2><p>Antons Blocked Drains Lower North Shore is provided by {site.operator}.</p><h2>Information You Provide</h2><p>If you call us, we may collect the contact and job information needed to respond, quote or provide drainage services. This may include your name, phone number, service address, access details and information about the blocked drain.</p><h2>How Information Is Used</h2><p>Information is used to respond to enquiries, arrange attendance, perform services, maintain business records and meet legal obligations. Contact the provider for questions about how your information is handled.</p><h2>Website Data</h2><p>We use Google Analytics to understand which pages people visit and how they use this website. Google Analytics uses cookies and collects information about visits, including page views, browser and device details, and referral sources. This information is processed by Google and helps us improve the website. You can manage cookies in your browser settings. The hosting service may process technical request information needed to deliver and protect the website. Please do not send sensitive information through a public website address or query string.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>For privacy questions, call <a href={site.phoneHref}>{site.phoneDisplay}</a>.</p></article>
</BaseLayout>
